          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Today</span><span class="info-stat-val">Havana is the capital and largest city of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cuba">Cuba</a> and is both a city and a province, with Old Havana on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/unesco">UNESCO</a>’s World Heritage list.</span></div>
